        "content": "Based on the image provided, this is **page 32 of the protocol (Protokoll)** for the village of **Grüble**, dated **August 9, 1830**.\n\n**Important Note:** This page is a **protocol/verification page (Abschrifts- und Vergleichsprotokoll)**, not the actual cadastral summary table (*Seßtevek* or *Kulturzusammenstellung*). It contains:\n\n1.  A list of 7 neighboring villages/boundaries (*Ränder*).\n2.  A descriptive text of the village boundaries.\n3.  The date and signatures of the commission members and witnesses.\n\nThe specific numerical list of cultures (Aecker, Wiesen, etc. with Joch/Klafter) you requested is **not present on this page**; it would typically be found on a different page (often labeled *Kultur-Auszug* or *Seßtevek*).\n\nBelow is the complete transcription of this page:\n\n---\n\n### Transcription of Page 32\n\n**Header / Boundary List:**\n```\nLind.\n1) Andern\n2) Minfen\n3) Elend G'schaid\n4) Grube [?] G'schaid\n5) Mitterwinkel\n6) Lutzgrübl\n7) Schwanzen mit Zähn [?] dachgrub\n```\n\n**Descriptive Text:**\n*(This is a continuous handwritten paragraph describing the boundary course, starting from \"Lind\" and proceeding through the listed points. Key legible phrases include:)*\n\"...von diesem anwächst nun der linke Fuß Pichlhorn bei lingst und den Grundrücken zum Gschwendel mit bucka von demselben, und unmittelbar dessen hingegen yfanchten, und zum Ersten westen liegen in der Gschwendel bewohnete Pichlhorn. Gschwendel endet sich? zu weiteren gegenwestigen Prakher zygflochten, und zyflachtigt.\"\n\n**Date:**\n```\nZu Grüble am 9ten August 1830\n```\n\n**Signatures (Left Side - Commission/Officials):**\n```\nEmig Robert Grübler\n          [illegible]\n```\n\n**Signatures (Right Side - Commission Members & Witnesses):**\n```\nGnom Poppo Gschwendler\nIvan Müllerjöggl\nGromy Lenjgan\nMilo Diziany\nGrony Lemig\nMarko Patrljung\nMary Jurkoffstöggl\nJaug Jaumplögg\nM[?]rumm[?]antyagan?\n```\n\n**Annotations (Right Margin):**\n```\nOberjäger\nMairinner\n```\n\n**Bottom Verification (dated later):**\n```\nGegenüft! und also zur Ruhm bestätiget.\nJ.J. Ejflizung [?] Lauckh in Grüble den 23ten 8ber 1830\n\nOrtban Fluderer\nJ.J. Ejflizung [?] Stathalter\n```\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Missing Data\nSince the **culture summary (Seßtevek)** with the Joch/Klafter numbers is not on this image, I cannot provide those specific digits. To obtain that data, you would need to locate the page titled **\"Kultur-Auszug\"** or **\"Zusammenstellung der Kulturen\"** within the same document, which typically follows or precedes this protocol page.",
